      "name": "Gradient Photography Wash",
      "role": "Decorative hero image treatment",
      "description": "Full-bleed editorial photograph with a soft coral→violet→blue gradient overlay (linear-gradient to right, #ff7759 → #7670c5 → #4c6ee6). 22px border-radius when used as a contained card. Functions as brand expression, not interface."
